{#- «كتاب الصف» picture (Addendum 1 §2): a shared class page with several children, or one child's personal
    cover. Order: style → setting → scene → children → outfit → composition → safety → negatives. -#}
{%- set light = {
  'dawn': 'soft pink-and-gold dawn light with long gentle shadows',
  'morning': 'fresh golden morning light',
  'noon': 'bright, even midday light with soft shadows',
  'afternoon': 'warm late-afternoon light',
  'sunset': 'glowing golden-orange sunset light',
  'evening': 'calm blue evening light with warm lamps glowing inside',
  'night': 'quiet moonlit night: deep blue sky, silver-gold moonlight and a warm lamp glow',
} -%}
STYLE
{{ style }}
Painting medium: {{ medium }}

SETTING
{{ setting }}

SCENE — {% if kind == 'cover' %}the FRONT COVER of one child's own copy of a kindergarten class book{% else %}one page of a kindergarten class picture book{% endif %}
{{ scene }}
{%- if location %}
Location (it looks exactly like this on every page set here): {{ location }}
{%- endif %}
Light: {{ light[time] }}.

CHILDREN
{%- if children %}
{%- for c in children %}
- CHILD {{ loop.index }} is the child in Image {{ c.ref }} (character reference sheet). Keep exactly the same face, skin tone, hair color and hairstyle, eye shape{% if c.glasses %}, the same glasses{% endif %}, age and body proportions. {{ 'A boy' if c.gender == 'm' else 'A girl' }}, about {{ c.age }} years old{% if c.hijab %}, wearing a soft hijab as in the reference{% else %}, with no hijab or head covering{% endif %}.
{%- endfor %}
{%- if kind == 'cover' %}
- CHILD 1 is the hero of this cover: draw them exactly once, large and central.
{%- else %}
- Draw each of these {{ children | length }} children exactly once, all clearly visible with their faces toward the viewer and easy to tell apart. They are equally important: nobody is hidden, turned away or cut off by the edge.
{%- endif %}
- Any teacher or other child stays in the background and looks clearly different from the children above.
{%- else %}
- A few kindergarten children of different looks take part, seen at a friendly distance. They are not specific real children: keep their faces simple and generic.
{%- endif %}

OUTFIT
The children wear {{ outfit }}.

COMPOSITION
{%- if kind == 'cover' %}
Front cover, square. Keep the TOP 30% calm and simple (sky or soft background) for the title. The hero is large and central in the lower two thirds, happy and confident, looking toward the reader.
{%- else %}
Square picture-book page. Keep the TOP 30% of the image calm and simple for the story text, with no faces, hands or key objects there; stage the children in the lower two thirds.
{%- endif %}
{{ composition }}

SAFETY
{{ safety }}

NEGATIVE
{{ negative }}
